  ('LBN-2021-018', 'Article 1', 'حماية مقدمي الرعاية الصحية والمصنعين من المسؤولية عن إصابات اللقاح (باستثناء الإهمال المتعمد)', 'ar', 'Law Regulating Emergency Use of Medical Products to Combat COVID-19 Pandemic, Article Article 1', 'Liability Protection', 'Recent Legislation - Healthcare and Pandemic Response'),
  ('LBN-2021-018', 'Article 2', 'Création d''un fonds de compensation pour blessures liées au vaccin COVID-19', 'fr', 'Law Regulating Emergency Use of Medical Products to Combat COVID-19 Pandemic, Article Article 2', 'Compensation Fund', 'Recent Legislation - Healthcare and Pandemic Response'),
  ('LBN-2021-018', 'Article 2', 'إنشاء صندوق تعويض للإصابات المرتبطة بلقاح كوفيد-19', 'ar', 'Law Regulating Emergency Use of Medical Products to Combat COVID-19 Pandemic, Article Article 2', 'Compensation Fund', 'Recent Legislation - Healthcare and Pandemic Response'),
  ('LBN-2021-018', 'Article 3', 'Autorisation du secteur privé d''acheter vaccins avec licence du ministère de la Santé', 'fr', 'Law Regulating Emergency Use of Medical Products to Combat COVID-19 Pandemic, Article Article 3', 'Private Sector Procurement', 'Recent Legislation - Healthcare and Pandemic Response'),
  ('LBN-2021-018', 'Article 3', 'السماح للقطاع الخاص بشراء اللقاحات بترخيص من وزارة الصحة', 'ar', 'Law Regulating Emergency Use of Medical Products to Combat COVID-19 Pandemic, Article Article 3', 'Private Sector Procurement', 'Recent Legislation - Healthcare and Pandemic Response'),
  ('LBN-2021-018', NULL, 'Provided legal framework for COVID-19 vaccination campaign. Shielded healthcare providers and manufacturers from liability. Allowed private sector to procure vaccines alongside government.', 'en', 'Law Regulating Emergency Use of Medical Products to Combat COVID-19 Pandemic — Historical Context', 'Historical context and overview', 'Recent Legislation - Healthcare and Pandemic Response'),
  ('LBN-2002-019', 'Article 1-3', 'Développement durable et préservation de l''environnement pour les générations futures', 'fr', 'Environmental Protection Law, Article Article 1-3', 'Sustainable Development', 'Recent Legislation - Environmental and Climate'),
  ('LBN-2002-019', 'Article 1-3', 'التنمية المستدامة والحفاظ على البيئة لأجيال المستقبل', 'ar', 'Environmental Protection Law, Article Article 1-3', 'Sustainable Development', 'Recent Legislation - Environmental and Climate'),
  ('LBN-2002-019', 'Article 20-25', 'Évaluation environnementale des grands projets (EIA)', 'fr', 'Environmental Protection Law, Article Article 20-25', 'Environmental Impact Assessment', 'Recent Legislation - Environmental and Climate'),
  ('LBN-2002-019', 'Article 20-25', 'التقييم البيئي للمشاريع الكبرى (EIA)', 'ar', 'Environmental Protection Law, Article Article 20-25', 'Environmental Impact Assessment', 'Recent Legislation - Environmental and Climate'),
  ('LBN-2002-019', 'Article 40-50', 'Surveillance de la pollution et normes qualité de l''air, eau et sol', 'fr', 'Environmental Protection Law, Article Article 40-50', 'Pollution Control', 'Recent Legislation - Environmental and Climate'),
  ('LBN-2002-019', 'Article 40-50', 'مراقبة التلوث ومعايير جودة الهواء والمياه والتربة', 'ar', 'Environmental Protection Law, Article Article 40-50', 'Pollution Control', 'Recent Legislation - Environmental and Climate'),
  ('LBN-2002-019', NULL, 'Cornerstone of Lebanese environmental legislation. Mandates Environmental Impact Assessments for major projects. Established framework for pollution control and biodiversity protection.', 'en', 'Environmental Protection Law — Historical Context', 'Historical context and overview', 'Recent Legislation - Environmental and Climate'),
  ('LBN-2018-020', 'Article 1', 'Cadre juridique pour surveillance et évaluation qualité de l''air', 'fr', 'Air Quality Law, Article Article 1', 'Air Quality Monitoring', 'Recent Legislation - Environmental and Climate'),
  ('LBN-2018-020', 'Article 1', 'إطار قانوني لمراقبة جودة الهواء وتقييمها', 'ar', 'Air Quality Law, Article Article 1', 'Air Quality Monitoring', 'Recent Legislation - Environmental and Climate'),
  ('LBN-2018-020', 'Article 5', 'Stratégie nationale pour gestion qualité de l''air ambiant 2015-2030', 'fr', 'Air Quality Law, Article Article 5', 'National Strategy', 'Recent Legislation - Environmental and Climate'),
